# FABLE-GROKBOT-MATRIX-20260924-143 cell: existing non-callable x primitive,
# three spellings. Physical operation = ASSIGNMENT (paren with a value is
# still assignment of that value -- not a call; empty `f()` refuses separately).
int: x 1
x: 2
if: x != 2
    return: 11
x(3)
if: x != 3
    return: 12
x:
    4
if: x != 4
    return: 13
return: 0
